          <li>Share routing table with neighbors</li>\\n                            <li>Use hop count as metric</li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                        \\n                        <h4>Link State Protocols</h4>\\n                        <ul>\\n                            <li>OSPF (Open Shortest Path First)</li>\\n                            <li>Maintain complete network topology</li>\\n                            <li>Use cost-based metrics</li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                        \\n                        <h4>Hybrid Protocols</h4>\\n                        <ul>\\n                            <li>EIGRP (Enhanced Interior Gateway Routing Protocol)</li>\\n                            <li>Combine benefits of both distance vector and link state</li>\\n                            <li>Fast convergence and efficient updates</li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n            ", "validation": {"type": "acknowledgment", "message": "Click 'Continue' when you've reviewed the content"}, "points": 10}, {"id": 2, "title": "Interactive Learning", "type": "interactive_exercise", "description": "Apply what you've learned", "content": "\\n            <div class=\\"interactive-panel\\">\\n                <h3>Practice Exercise</h3>\\n                <p>Based on the content you just reviewed, complete this interactive exercise.</p>\\n                <div class=\\"exercise-area\\">\\n                    <p>This simulation uses the troubleshoot.html layout with dynamic content.</p>\\n                    <p>Type: Networking 2</p>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n            ", "validation": {"type": "input_validation", "required_inputs": ["understanding"], "correct_answers": ["yes", "completed", "done"], "message": "Enter 'yes' when you understand the concepts"}, "points": 20}, {"id": 3, "title": "Assessment", "type": "knowledge_check", "description": "Validate 