rocesses</li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n                \\n                <div class=\\"lesson-section\\">\\n                    <h3>Documentation Best Practices</h3>\\n                    <ul>\\n                        <li>Keep documentation current and accurate</li>\\n                        <li>Use standardized formats and symbols</li>\\n                        <li>Version control and change tracking</li>\\n                        <li>Accessibility and organization</li>\\n                        <li>Regular reviews and updates</li>\\n                    </ul>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n            ", "validation": {"type": "acknowledgment", "message": "Click 'Continue' when you've reviewed the content"}, "points": 10}, {"id": 2, "title": "Interactive Learning", "type": "interactive_exercise", "description": "Apply what you've learned", "content": "\\n            <div class=\\"interactive-panel\\">\\n                <h3>Practice Exercise</h3>\\n                <p>Based on the content you just reviewed, complete this interactive exercise.</p>\\n                <div class=\\"exercise-area\\">\\n                    <p>This simulation uses the troubleshoot.html layout with dynamic content.</p>\\n                    <p>Type: Networking 2</p>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n            ", "validation": {"type": "input_validation", "required_inputs": ["understanding"], "correct_answers": ["yes", "completed", "done"], "message": "Enter 'yes' when you understand the concepts"}, "points": 20}, {"id": 3, "title": "Assessment", "type": "knowledge_check", "description": "Validate your understanding", "content": "\\n            <div class=\\"assessment-panel\\">\\n                <h3>Knowledge Check</h3>\\n                <p>Answer the following to complete this simulation:</p>\\n                <div class=\\"question-area\\">\\n                    <p>Rate your understanding of t